- @root: Return to main

@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the JSP to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 8; reformist_dissent += 3

We have increased the strength of the left faction with the JSP. This raised concern among the moderate reformists in the party.

@jcp_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the JCP
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the JCP as well as the JSP.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; kpd_relation += 6*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if kpd_cooperation_seen <= 1; kpd_cooperation_seen += 1

Katō attempts to reach out to his colleagues to dissuade the JCP from their current extreme Maoist and Stalinist path. Some concessions are extracted.

- @workers_organize
title: Organizing all of the labour force
subtitle: Improve our standing among the workers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; workers_jsp += 8*(1-dissent); new_middle_jsp += 5*(1-dissent);

We have increased our organizing among our worker bases.